#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "Keserasian ciri {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the selected feature:\n"
msgstr "Ciri-ciri runtime tertentu tidak boleh digunakan bersama dalam satu kerja. Klik tab yang sesuai untuk senarai ciri yang tidak serasi dengan ciri yang dipilih:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Might not work when using custom gates. Incompatible with:\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate pecahan\">\n"
"    Tidak serasi dengan:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Mungkin tidak berfungsi apabila menggunakan gate tersuai. Tidak serasi dengan:\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Tidak serasi dengan:\n"
"  - Gate pecahan\n"
"  - Regangan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Nota lain:\n"
"  - Twirling pengukuran hanya boleh diterapkan pada pengukuran terminal.\n"
"  - Tidak berfungsi dengan entangler bukan-Clifford.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Tidak serasi dengan:\n"
"  - Gate pecahan\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Tidak serasi dengan:\n"
"  - Gate pecahan\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

